# Formats read/written by the GraphInOut Mermaid reader.
# Object ids reference the graph-format-registry (https://github.com/calpano/graph-format-registry).
# 'mermaid' is not yet a registered format id.

graphinout-reader-mermaid ..has type.. tool
graphinout-reader-mermaid ..label.. GraphInOut Mermaid Reader
graphinout-reader-mermaid ..reads.. mermaid
graphinout-reader-mermaid ..writes.. mermaid
